  "description": "This walk visits Gartan Lough in County Donegal. The pretty lake is located about 15 kilometres (9 mi) west of Letterkenny.On the eastern side of the water you'll find a quiet country lane which is ideal for a peaceful walk or cycle. From here you can enjoy some find views across the lake to the hills and countryside on the opposite side.To continue your walking in the area try theLetterkenny Corrvaddy Forest Loop Walkor visit the nearbyLough Fern.",
